// BLOCK 13A — DIRTY GUARD RUNTIME STATE
//
// Operation: REPLACE THE DIRTY-GUARD INITIALIZATION FRAGMENT in
// scr_PunchReview.OnVisible.
//
// Locate the existing lines around:
// - varPunchReviewRequestedIndex
// - varPunchReviewPendingIndex
// - varPunchReviewShowDirtyDialog
//
// Keep the existing varPunchReviewRequestedIndex line and replace the guard
// initialization beneath it with the lines below.
//
// Purpose:
// - varPunchReviewPendingIndex remains numeric and uses 0 as no-target sentinel.
// - varPunchReviewPendingAction is explicitly typed as text.
// - entering Punch Review always starts with no stale decision dialog.

Set(varPunchReviewPendingIndex, 0);
Set(varPunchReviewPendingAction, "");
Set(varPunchReviewShowDirtyDialog, false);